00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:31,120
 there is no interaction between the user and the agent, then it's going to close that session.

89
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:35,800
 So that means you'll lose the short term memory.

90
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,240
 And next we have the action groups.

91
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:44,160
 So you can think of action groups as tools that you can integrate with your bedrock agents.

92
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:50,160
 So for our example, let's say for a flight booking agent, you might have a tool which

93
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:56,320
 takes the input from the end user like source destination date of travel name of the traveler

94
00:06:56,320 --> 00:07:04,200
 and then takes that data and makes an API call to the airline database to reserve a flight

95
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:06,760
 for our end user.

96
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:14,280
 So now if I just click on add and you have to provide the interaction group name, the description.

