00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:28,120
 You're going to get a response and that response is going to be passed to the agent.

132
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,120
 So that's all you define here.

133
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:32,600
 And we're going to create all this in lot of detail.

134
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,000
 So if you haven't understood, it's okay.

