00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:44,240
 Now that we have learned about action groups next, we have the memory.

138
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:51,080
 So this memory is a long term memory that bedrock agents enables for your use case.

139
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:56,240
 So by default, it's disabled, but once you click on enable, it will tell you for how long

