00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:13,320
 to be a supervisor agent.

201
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:16,760
 So in a multi agent scenario, you'll at least have three agents.

202
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:22,040
 So you'll have two agents who will be specialized agents or in other terms, they are called

203
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:26,160
 as collaborator agents, they will be the worker agents.

204
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:31,560
 And then you will have a supervisor agent, which takes the request from the end user and

205
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:38,960
 then determines based on certain criteria, which agent it can forward that request to.

206
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:42,280
 And here we select the supervisor agent.

207
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:47,200
 And then we have the specialized agent or collaborator agents as they are called.

208
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:52,040
 So you can select which collaborator agent you want to use.

209
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:54,120
 Okay, that's pretty much it from this lecture.

